          "body": "Some overhaul was done to the URIUtil package recently.  Is this still a problem?",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=jsdever%40sympatico.ca",
            "name": "jsdever@sympatico.ca",
            "key": "jsdever@sympatico.ca",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Jeff Dever",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2002-10-29T14:53:27.000+0000",
          "updated": "2002-10-29T14:53:27.000+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12333665/comment/12379615",
          "id": "12379615",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=armando.anton%40newknow.com",
            "name": "armando.anton@newknow.com",
            "key": "armando.anton@newknow.com",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Armando Ant\u00f3n",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "I don't understand why the path is encoded but the queryString not\nI think it is a bug and the path must not be encoded because the path and query \nare well-formed in this point and encoding them can cause unexpected behaviours\n\n(more info)The query encoding was removed in revision 1.69\n\nHttpMethodBase v1.95 (generateRequestLine method). Current code:\n\n        StringBuffer buf = new StringBuffer();\n        String path = null;\n        try {\n            path = (requestPath == null) ? \"/\" : URIUtil.encodePath\n(requestPath);\n        } catch (URIException urie) {\n            log.error(\"URI path encoding error\");\n            path = requestPath;\n        }\n        buf.append(path);\n        if (query != null) {\n            if (query.indexOf(\"?\") != 0) {\n                buf.append(\"?\");\n            }\n            String queryString = null;\n            queryString = (query == null) ? \"/\" : query;\n            buf.append(queryString);\n        }",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=armando.anton%40newknow.com",
            "name": "armando.anton@newknow.com",
            "key": "armando.anton@newknow.com",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Armando Ant\u00f3n",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2003-01-17T03:11:04.000+0000",
          "updated": "2003-01-17T03:11:04.000+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12333665/comment/12379616",
          "id": "12379616",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=olegk",
            "name": "olegk",
            "key": "olegk",
            "avatarUrls": {
